<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have renewed attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking the East West oil pipeline and a pumping station. Saudi forces say they intercepted missiles and drones, with debris falling near Mecca, which the Houthis deny targeting. Pakistan has called for an immediate end to Houthi attacks as the UN Security Council renews Yemen sanctions. France’s foreign ministry spokesperson says France favours adding pressure on the Houthis, and the conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPcXIwbkFRM3dlZktvS0VBdHVLQURXY28xdmxYVnNnUUk3Sy1RRmd0dTNBeFhWS29TVVM1RVh3aGd5cmpObC1naWw4a25qTXRPOTRndFY0REw5UlY4d2tlR1dzMFNhbmlXc0NHSXMwWVpZcFZhOE1vQllfT3ZWZXU1X00wLWhiRnNPdmdnQnI4SUJrb0Q5eHRPRmlKYzg1akt0U0ZnM29LejY?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5VWWVhRjlMVjR4M2ZBOEZ2MmphcFhXc2YyZGNIUnJXOV9uX1c0Sm8yNjFoS2owVVF0UE5ENy1UMDBpZnZjdTVUOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPOHNyWUhKaHR2QmJXUjJ6S0xNdDZnZmpKRzJQak9SWVc3cmttUGVfbk13NzBZclpqNnp5N1JFc0JYakw2Wl9hV3BYdm1mMnJQR3BKRFI2Zzh3cVRhTFFxejBSVWtTMkt2WTRGRUxFSkVocF83aFlIOU10Vk11d29TRERPcnFVWHRJYktFOUlGU0x4c0Q0UWVtT3JkUE91ZVNPQ09NTnhaMGxJajZxQnkwWTFvTzN4WnNpMTBYalNZOHFZdnUtX1VHeUVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
